{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_tomimi_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_tomimi_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "嶄新生活",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_tomimi_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "48d6310d3f822ad311783aacefc3d289af59b9fb8d4ef7fc641623f55f0a79be",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅德島本艦\n宿舍區 嘉維爾的宿舍前"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "早上好嘉維爾，該起床了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（不在......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（好奇怪啊，嘉維爾今天起那麼早嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（還是去食堂看看吧，說不定已經在吃早飯了呢。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（這裡也沒有嘉維爾......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（既不在睡覺，也不在食堂吃飯。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（可能今天有什麼重要的事吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（她最近應該沒有外勤任務，那就只有在醫療部了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "欸，欸？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "怎，怎麼會這樣？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "我也是聽同事們聊起才知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "昨天晚上附近聚居點有份緊急委託，情況還很複雜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "為了保證其他幹員的安全，需要醫療部派遣一位作戰經驗和醫療經驗同等豐富的幹員隨行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "這樣的情況整個醫療部只有嘉維爾最合適了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "任務真的很急，部署當晚全體承接委託的幹員就離開羅德島了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "這個......怎麼會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "她應該給你留了訊息吧，留言、紙條之類的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（打開通訊終端）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "沒，沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "怎麼會這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（離開阿卡胡拉的時候，她，她就沒來和我打招呼......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "嘉維爾她不會......不會又要丟下我吧？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "呃，你想多了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我現在就去幫忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "哎哎哎等等，你怎麼去啊，走過去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我......我開車過去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "用車要申請的，再說了你都不知道目的地，又能開到哪裡去呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "最重要的是，你不會開車呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我，我可以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "唔，唔唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "哭，哭什麼呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "唉別哭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "嗚嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "我知道你擔心嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "但你也應該知道，嘉維爾有什麼好擔心的呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "別人傷不到她的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我怕她......擦......擦破皮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "她是醫療幹員，這種程度的傷自己能治好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "可是，萬一她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "好了好了，你在這裡哭訴也不是個辦法，對吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "先回去休息一下，穩定自己的情緒，做些能讓自己快樂的事，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "任務雖然急，但不是很困難的，說不定過個三四天嘉維爾就凱旋歸來了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "不要自己嚇自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "好，好的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "不好意思給你添麻煩了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "沒事的，哈哈，回去休息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "好的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "沒想到小迷妹沒了嘉維爾反應那麼大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "可能是當初一扭頭就走給人心裡留下陰影了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "下次得提醒她，走之前要記得和親友報個信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "不然再發生一次，特米米怕不是要用淚水把醫療部給淹了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "會發生這麼悲傷的事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "或許吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "請坐，藍毒小姐，身體有哪裡不舒服嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "嘉維爾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "嘉維爾出任務了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我也想和嘉維爾一起出任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "做些讓自己快樂的事啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我該做什麼呢？我能做什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "要是我也能變得強大起來就好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "這裡是，哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "又在羅德島裡迷路了，要是被嘉維爾知道會被敲腦袋的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（前面有人，問問她吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "嗯，你好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "你好，阿達克利斯，有什麼能幫到您的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "（優雅的提裙禮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "唔，唔唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（模仿了一下提裙禮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "你好，我想問一下這裡是哪裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "如果您是指具體位置的話，這裡是前往羅德島機庫的通道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "謝謝你，黎博利姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "不客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "您好像，有些迷茫，需要我幫忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我迷路了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "原來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "您在哪條道路上迷失了方向？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "抱歉，我好像問了個傻問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "咳嗯，那麼，您現在想去哪裡呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我想......買最新的時尚雜誌，離開阿卡胡拉以後很久沒看了，心裡有些癢癢的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "雜誌，嗯，我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "買雜誌的話坐旁邊的電梯上兩層，出門右轉筆直走，看到小噴泉以後左轉，就能看到書攤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "價格可能比城市裡的稍高些，但供貨穩定，品種多樣，還能預訂想要的書刊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "是這樣啊，謝謝你，我現在就去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "請稍等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "在出發之前，能先煩請您解答一下我的小小疑惑嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "嗯？嗯，直接問就行了，不用那麼禮貌的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "嗯，下次會注意的~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "阿達克利斯，肩上的擔子，還重嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "擔子？你是說背包嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（掂了下背包）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "還好吧，沒有那麼重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "裡面都是精挑細選的寶貝，得貼身帶著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "放宿舍不好嗎，那裡是你在羅德島的家園。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "萬一找不到了，我會難過的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "少任何一件都不行，還是帶在身邊比較合適。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "你的回憶，你的寄託，嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "有沒有想過放在保險箱裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "那可不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "鎖在箱子裡的話，寶物們會生氣的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "那麼，好好佈置一下宿舍，把它變成僅屬於你的展館，會不會更好呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "懂得背負回憶是好事，但學會卸下負荷並裝點它，或許會更有意義呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "唔，你說的，我不太懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "沒什麼，只是一位黎博利毫無意義的自言自語罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "我的疑問已經得到了答案，謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "需要我幫忙引路嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "不用麻煩的，我想我能夠認得路，謝謝你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "那我就先離開了，阿達克利斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "或許我們很快就會再相見的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "（薩爾貢方言）願你的遠景如廣林般浩瀚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "（優雅的提裙禮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（她好像走得很急。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（通道那一頭的黎博利，是她的妹妹嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（她們好像很親密的樣子。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（真好啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（小噴泉到了，左轉......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "就是這裡了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "嗚啊，羅德島上也會有這樣的攤子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "您是第一次光臨小店吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "店裡空間不夠大，有時候貨太多放不下了就會在店外擺個小地攤，當然，這都是提前申請報備的，可不是什麼違規操作哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "您要買什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我想買最新的時尚雜誌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "時尚雜誌有很多種，你看，有介紹掛墜首飾的，有發佈名人新聞的，有主打潮流服裝的，還有——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "請給我關於服裝的，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "這個......最新一期賣完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "好吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（今天運氣好像不太行的樣子......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "不過你運氣不錯，買掉最後一本的幹員還在，如果你特別想看的話，可以問問她願不願意和你分享。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "是哪位呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "那裡，粉色頭髮的就是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "她叫藍毒，每次都是第一個來買雜誌的，今天好像有些事，差點就沒買到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "你去和她搭個話吧，我想她會願意借給你看的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "好的，謝謝你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "唉，我還沒說完呢，她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "算了，多一句不如少一句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "或許這樣能讓藍毒多個朋友呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "您，您好......請問是藍毒姐姐嗎，我叫特米米。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（她就是特米米嗎？真是巧合。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（伸出手）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你是......要和我握手，嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "唔，我只是想，嗯，出於禮貌......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "如果你討厭的話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（握了握特米米的手）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我是藍毒，很高興認識你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "因為一些原因，別人不太願意和我，接觸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "所以你伸手的時候我愣住了，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "找我有什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我想借雜誌看一下，可以嗎，馬上就還給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "雜誌？你是說這本《自我迷宮》？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "不好意思，我維多利亞語不太好，不是很能理解上面的字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我也才剛買到，還沒看呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "這裡人太多了，我們找個地方坐下來慢慢看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "好的，拜託你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "看完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "謝謝你，藍毒姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "嗯？嗯，不客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "特米米小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "叫我特米米就好，加上尊稱的話總覺得好像有點奇怪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "啊，好，特米米。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "早上......是發生了什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "醫療部那邊的幹員說你的淚水會把整個醫療部都淹了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "這個......講出來還挺難為情的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "說出來心裡會好受些，試試看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "其實，是這樣的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "大概就是這麼回事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "請不要笑話我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "怎麼會呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我聽說，阿達克利斯人從不會流淚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "流淚是示弱的表現，所以絕對不可以在別人面前哭的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "即便如此，你也願意為嘉維爾小姐哭泣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "這並不是件難以啟齒的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "唔，謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你好像對服裝類的雜誌很感興趣，你的家鄉也有這樣的刊物嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "沒有，不過依娜姆偶爾會幫我從外面帶過來一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "她是我們那邊做生意的人，經常幫忙從外面帶些有意思的東西回來，還教我語言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "等學會語言以後，我就買她那裡的書來看，有些書裡的內容特別喜歡，就看得多了點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "比如說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "《都市麗人》之類的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "嗯哼，那算是比較知名的時尚雜誌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "只是......東西做得太過流水和規範，反而失了打出名聲時的靈氣，唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "聽說他們有幾個編輯和攝影師想跳出來自立門戶，也不知道能不能成功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "藍毒姐姐，對時尚很瞭解的樣子，好厲害......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "算不上呢，只是看得多，有一些自己的品味和堅持而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你呢，特米米，對你來說，時尚是什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我不太清楚，我們那邊的方言沒有描述時尚的詞彙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "打人倒是有好幾種。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我覺得，時尚應該就是好看的衣服，簡單又漂亮的首飾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "阿卡胡拉沒有這樣的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "第一次翻開那本雜誌的時候，我才知道，原來衣服也能是那種顏色，那樣的造型。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "有些衣服的樣子，我可能永遠都想像不到，但它會在某一天，出現在我從依娜姆那裡買來的雜誌上，而且我能很肯定地說——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "——我喜歡那件衣服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你不是很瞭解嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "其實我現在身上穿的這一套，也是從雜誌上看到喜歡的衣服以後，想辦法做了整套然後自己改良的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "雖然有些破......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "啊，我好像有些印象......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（打開並翻閱自己的隨身筆記）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "瑪爾特......狂野......怒嚎......泳裝系列......珊瑚海岸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "來看看，當初是這套嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "唔，是的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "藍毒姐姐是怎麼知道的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "積累而已，有時候遇見特別喜歡的設計會剪下來貼在這本筆記裡，然後寫些自己的心得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "剪，剪下來？那樣雜誌不會壞掉嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "這個，怎麼說呢......算是我個人的習慣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "剪貼畫報的確是破壞了書籍的整體性，但對我來說，它是一條捷徑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "捷徑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "把一本雜誌中你最想要獲得的知識，放到一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "然後透過這條捷徑，來到這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "到腦袋裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "嗯哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我手上的這本，已經是第六本筆記了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "最早的幾本，只有在想懷舊的時候才會翻出來看幾眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "上面除了回憶以外，已經什麼都不剩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "真正重要的，全在腦子裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "成為了審美、品味、格調。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "腦袋真的能記住那麼多嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "當然不會，它只留下你最不想忘記的部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "比如，你對美的選擇和追求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "或者，對你來說的話，嗯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "嘉維爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "唔，你說得對，嘉維爾的確忘不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "最重要的回憶，總是在腦袋裡的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "物品有時只是開啟它們的鑰匙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "等到你把回憶鞏固成自動門，就再也不需要鑰匙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "有，有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "鑰匙......寶物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "回憶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "特米米，你有試過穿搭嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "穿搭？沒，還沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "那我們現在就去商店試衣，怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "試衣？可，可以嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "雖然種類沒有移動城市裡的商場那麼齊全，但可以先帶你體驗一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "如果你不介意的話，我可以找位裁縫一起去，幫你多提供點穿搭上的建議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "這，這個，真的可以辦到嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "可以呢，如果你想的話，在羅德島上都可以全身訂製一整套衣服哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（小聲嘀咕）只是價格不太親民......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "好，好的，我，呃，我，我準備一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "一會要試衣服，對吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "那我，我，我先回宿舍把背包放下，這樣試衣服的時候可以輕鬆些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "您能認識到這點，可是一件值得慶賀的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "啊，是剛才遇到的黎博利姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "之前忘做自我介紹了，請您原諒我的疏忽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "阿絲忒希婭·烏比卡，大家一般稱呼我為星極。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "很高興認識你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "你好，星極姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（伸出手）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "（輕盈地握了下手）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "下午好，星極小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "下午好，藍毒小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我想帶特米米去試一下衣服，您要是方便的話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "正巧我也想選幾件新衣服，能和各位同行是我莫大的榮幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "柏喙小姐的話，應該還在書攤那裡買刊物吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "哎呀，看來我猜對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（真是什麼事都瞞不過她......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我先去和柏喙打個招呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "一會見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（小聲）星極，星極姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "（小聲）怎麼啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（小聲）你之前說的，佈置成展館，大概是怎麼做啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "（小聲）來，看到那邊的小噴泉了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（小聲）嗯嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "（小聲）噴泉上有個浮雕，是不是很漂亮？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（小聲）嗯嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "（小聲）如果那個浮雕是你精心保存的藏品，你會不會覺得，很開心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（小聲）嗯......嗯嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "（小聲）就是這麼回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "（小聲）把美好的回憶放在特別為其製作的台座上，總是一件能夠讓人欣喜的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "（小聲）如果有需要，還可以在台座上加裝其他裝置，可以防止外力破壞，也能把物品的壽命延長許多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（小聲）聽起來挺不錯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "（小聲）那，有，有空的話，可不可以麻煩您，幫忙，嗯，規劃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "（小聲）沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "（小聲）裝飾挑選有它的講究，等你試完了衣裳，我們再慢慢研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "現在先去和藍毒小姐她們會合吧，讓她們久等可不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "特米米。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "怎麼了星極姐姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "現在心情好些了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "做自己喜歡的事，很開心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "嗯，那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星極",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "我們出發吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "好的，星極姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "羅德島和阿卡胡拉的區別是有一點大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "這裡有很多不能做的事，房間也比較小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "但我不是很在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我能在這裡學到很多新知識，認識到新朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "沒有比這更令人開心的事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "或許我可以在這裡成為一個時尚達人、探險家、術師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "或者有探險精神的時尚術師？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "未來又會發生什麼有趣的事呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "我真的很期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "嘉維爾也是因為這些原因，才選擇留在羅德島，而不是待在阿卡胡拉吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "不知道嘉維爾現在又在做些什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "忍住啊，也就疼一下的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "疼死了你輕點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "只是疼，死不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "包紮好了，你按住傷口，我去和客人打個招呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "喂，怎麼有人溜到我這裡來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤隊長",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "抱歉嘉維爾，就偷溜了那一個，其他人全搞定了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤隊長",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "所有人，原地休整，注意警戒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "全體外勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "呼，終於結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "嗯，你沒事就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "你這次出任務那麼急，有和你家鄉的朋友打過招呼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "這有什麼好打招呼的，都是熟人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "別人我不太清楚，但那個經常來醫療部看你的同族，你總要和她說聲吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "萬一沒找到你，她不哭到把羅德島給淹了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "我們阿卡胡拉出來的人都是一頂一的強者，特米米可沒那麼脆弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "再說了，之前幫星極做了點事，萬一有事，她肯定會出手幫一把的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "行啊你早都算好了啊，當我沒說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "別嘮叨了，趕緊幫我看看任務結束以後，我們在哪個位置和羅德島本艦會合？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "好，等一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "嗯......這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "本艦會在這座城市停靠，進行休整和補給。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "聽說這還是座度假城市，城裡有大片的濱水沙灘對遊客開放。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "我們正好能放個假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "那不錯嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "（度假城市......濱水沙灘？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "（要不，給她買套水邊穿的衣服？她應該會喜歡的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "（就當是，道個歉吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
